      "flags": {},
      "order": 4,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Start here",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Reusable identity workflow\n1. Upload the base image on the left.\n2. In PERSON, upload a photo folder or choose a saved profile. Click a thumbnail to use it as the reference; check which photos train the identity.\n3. Train identity once for a new person, then Run to render. A profile without a trained adapter can run using its reference photo.\n4. Choose an expression mode. Neutral is selected for this base; Match base image or Custom work with other poses and expressions.\n\nThe selected profile supplies its own identity token and trained adapter. The shared edit instructions contain no fixed person or facial features.\nHead-swap strength and identity strength are separate controls. Stronger settings can soften skin; more steps alone may not fix that.\nAll photo storage and training stay on this PC."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Reusable identity workflow\n1. Upload the base image on the left.\n2. In PERSON, upload a photo folder or choose a saved profile. Click a thumbnail to use it as the reference; check which photos train the identity.\n3. Train identity once for a new person, then Run to render. A profile without a trained adapter can run using its reference photo.\n4. Choose an expression mode. Neutral is selected for this base; Match base image or Custom work with other poses and expressions.\n\nThe selected profile supplies its own identity token and trained adapter. The shared edit instructions contain no fixed person or facial features.\nHead-swap strength and identity strength are separate controls. Stronger settings can soften skin; more steps alone may not fix that.\nAll photo storage and training stay on this PC."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
